!eclmap

# TH06NC -- ECL additions over the TH06 instruction set.
#
# OVERLAY, same caveat as the .anmm: only what we derived first-hand.
# Both names below are PROVISIONAL -- the math is verified, the intent is not.

!ins_names
200 SHOOTOFFSETPOLAR  # Verified math and destination fields; name is provisional until all call-site semantics are documented.
201 BULLETPATTERNMODE134  # Provisional: shares the TH06 67..75 bullet handler and selects internal aimMode 134.

!timeline_ins_names
13 CHECKPOINT  # Consumed by the ECL loader, outside the runtime timeline switch.
14 MARKER14  # Argument-free no-op marker in the current runtime; observed once in ecldata7.ecl.
